<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Internal Medicine • Clinic 4A</span>
</div>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-semibold" id="modalCurrentSlot">Tomorrow, 09:00 AM</span>
